From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Weegee <748975+Weegee@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 13:12:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] debugfs: name the directory after the module

The MacBook9,1 package builds the driver as macbook91-facetimehd, so the
debugfs directory follows KBUILD_MODNAME instead of a fixed name.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 fthd_debugfs.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/fthd_debugfs.c b/fthd_debugfs.c
index deb6318..1b06914 100644
--- a/fthd_debugfs.c
+++ b/fthd_debugfs.c
@@ -251,7 +251,7 @@ int fthd_debugfs_init(struct fthd_private *dev_priv)
 {
 	struct dentry *d, *top;
 
-	top = debugfs_create_dir("facetimehd", NULL);
+	top = debugfs_create_dir(KBUILD_MODNAME, NULL);
 	if (IS_ERR(top))
 		return PTR_ERR(top);
 
